### Maven ###
# Written by flatten-maven-plugin at process-resources and removed again by `mvn clean`.
# It is the POM that actually gets installed/deployed (with ${revision} resolved), a build
# output rather than a source file.
.flattened-pom.xml

### code-index MCP server
# Fallback location for the code index state, used only when $TMPDIR is unwritable.
# It is a rebuildable ~6.5MB SQLite cache, never a source file. See docs/code-index.md.
.code_indexer/
